{
  "id": "cert-precheck", "version": "1.0",
  "name": "Certification Pre-Check",
  "blurb": "typical gaps before CE/FCC (filtering, grounding, labels) as a checklist",
  "group": "project",
  "rooms": [
    "analyze"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "ce",
    "fcc",
    "certification",
    "compliance",
    "emc",
    "emi",
    "esd",
    "red",
    "lvd",
    "part 15",
    "en 55032",
    "en 55035",
    "pre-compliance",
    "labeling",
    "declaration of conformity"
  ],
  "intro": "Tick what the design already does; what is open comes back with why it fails or delays CE / FCC testing, critical items first. Items follow EN 55032/55035, IEC 62368-1, RED and FCC Part 15; set market, power and radio first so only the items that apply count.",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "key": "market",
      "label": "Market",
      "type": "select",
      "default": "both",
      "options": [
        [
          "both",
          "EU (CE) and US (FCC)"
        ],
        [
          "ce",
          "EU only (CE)"
        ],
        [
          "fcc",
          "US only (FCC)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "power",
      "label": "Power",
      "type": "select",
      "default": "lowv",
      "options": [
        [
          "battery",
          "Battery only"
        ],
        [
          "lowv",
          "USB / external adapter"
        ],
        [
          "mains",
          "Mains inside the product"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "radio",
      "label": "Radio",
      "type": "select",
      "default": "module",
      "options": [
        [
          "none",
          "No radio"
        ],
        [
          "module",
          "Pre-certified module"
        ],
        [
          "discrete",
          "Own RF design"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "battery",
      "label": "Has a lithium cell",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "f_input",
      "label": "Power input filter",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "power",
        "in": [
          "lowv",
          "mains"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "f_cables",
      "label": "Cables filtered/shielded",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "f_decouple",
      "label": "Per-pin decoupling",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "f_edges",
      "label": "Edges slowed",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "f_switcher",
      "label": "DC/DC hot loop tight",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "g_plane",
      "label": "Solid ground plane",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "g_shield",
      "label": "Shields bonded at connector",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "g_edge",
      "label": "Edge via stitching",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "g_crystal",
      "label": "Crystal guarded",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "e_esd",
      "label": "ESD diodes (CE)",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "e_reset",
      "label": "Reset/boot filtered (CE)",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "e_surge",
      "label": "Surge/EFT protection (CE)",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "power",
        "in": [
          "lowv",
          "mains"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "e_recover",
      "label": "Self-recovery (CE)",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "s_creepage",
      "label": "Mains creepage/clearance",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "power",
        "equals": "mains"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "s_fuse",
      "label": "Mains fuse",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "power",
        "equals": "mains"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "s_adapter",
      "label": "Certified adapter",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "power",
        "equals": "lowv"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "s_battery",
      "label": "Li cell PCM + reports (Li)",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "r_grant",
      "label": "Module within its grant",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "radio",
        "equals": "module"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "r_keepout",
      "label": "Antenna keep-out",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "radio",
        "in": [
          "module",
          "discrete"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "r_red",
      "label": "RED test plan (CE)",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "radio",
        "in": [
          "module",
          "discrete"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "r_exposure",
      "label": "RF exposure assessed",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "radio",
        "in": [
          "module",
          "discrete"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "r_discrete",
      "label": "Intentional radiator tests",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "radio",
        "equals": "discrete"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "r_testmode",
      "label": "Radio test firmware",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false,
      "when": {
        "key": "radio",
        "in": [
          "module",
          "discrete"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "l_ce",
      "label": "CE mark + address (CE)",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "l_weee",
      "label": "WEEE / RoHS (CE)",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "l_fcc",
      "label": "FCC label (FCC)",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "l_manual",
      "label": "Manual statements",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "l_doc",
      "label": "DoC + technical file",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "p_prescan",
      "label": "Pre-scan done",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "p_worst",
      "label": "Worst-case mode defined",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": false
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "BLE sensor on USB power, module-based, design half done",
      "input": {
        "market": "both",
        "power": "lowv",
        "radio": "module",
        "battery": true,
        "f_input": true,
        "f_decouple": true,
        "g_plane": true,
        "g_crystal": true,
        "e_esd": true,
        "s_adapter": true,
        "r_grant": true,
        "r_keepout": true,
        "l_doc": false
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Mains-powered controller, no radio, EU only",
      "input": {
        "market": "ce",
        "power": "mains",
        "radio": "none",
        "f_input": true,
        "f_cables": true,
        "g_plane": true,
        "s_fuse": true,
        "e_esd": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "usage": "Give market (ce, fcc or both), power (battery, lowv or mains), radio (none, module or discrete) and battery (bool), then true for each item already done (keys f_*, g_*, e_*, s_*, r_*, l_*, p_*). It returns progress, the number of critical open items, a table of open items with why each matters, and the regulations in scope. Use it before a pre-scan or lab booking, or when reviewing a design for compliance risk.",
  "sources": [
    "EMC Directive 2014/30/EU with EN 55032 (CISPR 32) and EN 55035 (IEC 61000-4-2/-4/-5)",
    "Low Voltage Directive 2014/35/EU and IEC/EN 62368-1",
    "Radio Equipment Directive 2014/53/EU: EN 300 328, EN 301 489-1/-17, EN 62311",
    "47 CFR Part 15 (15.19, 15.105, 15.107, 15.109, Subpart C), FCC KDB 996369 (modular transmitters)",
    "Decision 768/2008/EC (CE marking), WEEE 2012/19/EU, RoHS 2011/65/EU",
    "H. W. Ott, Electromagnetic Compatibility Engineering (design items, rule of thumb)"
  ],
  "prompt": "For each open item above, suggest the concrete change to the design, the layout or the paperwork, starting with the critical ones."
}